  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maize Milling and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to build a warehouse and help the cooperative bulk and collectively sell member-grown maize. By improving the groups capacity to manage and finance these larger operations; farmers will receive greater funds than selling on their own to local purchasers.</narrative>
  </description>
